<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT NAMIBIA 7-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EGYPT BEAT NAMIBIA 7-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt beat Namibia 7-1 (halftime</p>
<p>4-1) in a World Cup African zone group two qualifier on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Egypt - Ali Maher (1), Ahmed Hassan (11), Ali Maher (15),</p>
<p>Ibrahim Hassan (35), Ali Maher (70), Hussam Hassan (73, 84)</p>
<p>Namibia - Elifas Shivute (25)</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
</text>
